## Find the First Non-Repeating Character

Example:

Input:  swiss
Characters:
s → 3 times
w → 1 time ✅
i → 1 time
First non-repeating character = w
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

text = input("Enter a string: ")

for char in text:
    if text.count(char) == 1:
        print("First non-repeating character:", char)
        break
else:
    print("No non-repeating character")
